  "steps": [
    "Cook the rice with the water and a little of the salt until fluffy, then spread out to cool slightly.",
    "Heat the coconut oil and crackle the mustard seeds.",
    "Add the chana dal, urad dal and cashews and fry until golden.",
    "Add the red chillies, green chilli, ginger and curry leaves and fry for 30 seconds.",
    "Add the grated coconut and sauté on low heat for 2 minutes without browning it.",
    "Fold in the rice and the remaining salt gently and serve warm."
  ]
